# Antigravity/Gemini Ignore File
# This file prevents the Antigravity agent from indexing or reading specified files/folders,
# helping to reduce token consumption and keep context focused on Android development.

# --- Non-Android Flutter Platforms ---
# Since you are focused on Android app development, we ignore other platform implementations:
sandesh/ios/
sandesh/linux/
sandesh/macos/
sandesh/windows/
sandesh/web/

# --- Build and Cache Directories ---
# Ignore large compiler and package manager caches/build outputs:
sandesh/build/
sandesh/.dart_tool/
sandesh/.pub/
sandesh/.pub-cache/

# --- IDE and Editor Configurations ---
# Avoid reading metadata from editors:
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# --- System Files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Large/Binary/Media Files ---
# These files cannot be parsed as text and should be ignored to save tokens:
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ttf
*.otf
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# --- Android Files and Security Keys ---
# Explicitly allowing Android source files, XML configs, and security files
# so that the AI can configure signing and build setups for you:
!sandesh/android/
!*.xml
!*.keystore
!*.jks
!*.properties
!google-services.json
